      "markdownText": "# Battery Returns Intelligence\n## Every return has a story. Follow the evidence.\nExplore **who initiated a return**, **what was reported**, and **what inspection found**.\n\n**SYNTHETIC DEMO DATA** | Bronze \u2192 Silver \u2192 Gold \u2192 Eventhouse\n\nThe original Fabric dashboard now uses native filters and visuals. The custom AI chat remains in the separate companion app.",
