      "layout": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "width": 24,
        "height": 3
      },
      "markdownText": "**Dashboard controls:** Country and Registered (UTC) filter the Gold case visuals. Paid capacity scenario, Cost currency, and Charged hrs/day affect only the estimate.\n\n**Estimate basis:** West Central US retail PAYG, prices checked **2026-11-04**; USD **0.2** / INR **19.04575** per CU-hour. **Current workspace: FT1 trial.** No subscription or resource is changed by these controls.\n\n**Excluded:** OneLake storage/transactions, bandwidth, licenses, taxes, overage, and optional services. These are whole-capacity estimates, not measured workspace bills or sizing recommendations. **Rates are a dated snapshot, not automatically refreshed.** [Official Fabric pricing](https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/pricing/details/microsoft-fabric/).",
      "hideTitle": true
    },
